  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0009_fb67e88d5513.png\" style=\"width:2.85347in;height:1.56042in\" /></p><p>In&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>ABE</mi></math>,<br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />and in <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>,<br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Also, <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> (Similar triangles)<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>300</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>100</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> [using Eq. <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> ]<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>300</mn><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
